From 95eeb81b70e3c6ce0449d8769dff1bcfe4296671 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Lukin <mylukin@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 6 Apr 2026 11:05:37 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix: 14 remaining issues from best-practice and UX review

Quick fixes:
1. Dedup regex: handle quoted id= variants in normalizeMentionsForDedup
   to match mention.ts AT_ID_TAG_RE (prevents false-negative dedup)
2. closeStreaming: add closingInProgress guard to prevent concurrent entry
3. Streaming renewal: retry after 30s on failure instead of waiting 8min
4. ZERO_USAGE: Object.freeze to prevent accidental mutation
5. Slug generator: cache isCliProvider result to avoid redundant call
6. removeActiveTool: log warning on toolCallId mismatch pop fallback

Medium fixes:
7. Token estimation: linear interpolation (4 - cjkRatio*2.5) replaces
   binary 30% threshold that caused 2.67x discontinuity
8. Sender name cache: add 60-min periodic cleanup for expired entries
   and backoff timestamps to prevent unbounded Map growth
9. Bootstrap compaction: validate LLM output contains markdown headers
   before caching, preventing garbage output from polluting sessions
10. restrictToStoreDir: default to true for session archive path safety
11. transcriptHasIdempotencyKey: deduplicate into shared canonical impl
12. Hook cancel feedback: show "[Message filtered by policy]" to user
    when message_sending hook cancels a final delivery

UX improvements:
14. Tool elapsed time: show "Running tool... (30s)" with 10s refresh
    timer in thinking panel during long tool executions
15. Image pre-analysis: parallel execution via Promise.allSettled
    instead of sequential per-image analysis

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
